                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ca462148-3f5b-3a26-b0f0-f92a69000d46",
                        "entry_id": "f2813465-44b9-386d-b9a9-993ce951e72b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Medizinerin, die sich mit der Zahnheilkunde beschäftigt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7979b849-4e41-43b1-b423-d1891e163546",
                                "sense_id": "ca462148-3f5b-3a26-b0f0-f92a69000d46",
                                "text": "Die Zahnärztin kontrollierte meine Zahnfüllungen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f212697-9014-4153-b239-9f0603b6f2f9",
                                "sense_id": "ca462148-3f5b-3a26-b0f0-f92a69000d46",
                                "text": "„Wir werden aufgerufen, die Zahnärztin strahlt Ruhe aus.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f640dfbb-6d5b-4064-9800-558d2cbc491a",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2813465-44b9-386d-b9a9-993ce951e72b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ca462148-3f5b-3a26-b0f0-f92a69000d46",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizinerin, die sich mit der Zahnheilkunde beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "dentist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dentist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38b0d4a9-bb43-3338-bfe1-b73ff65cbdb4",
                                        "entry_id": "090c221b-5989-3bd4-9b7d-740c71de482c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medical doctor who specializes in teeth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce992f4-897c-4f3e-b7d5-70ee4ccf0ea5",
                                                "sense_id": "38b0d4a9-bb43-3338-bfe1-b73ff65cbdb4",
                                                "text": "It is singular how forcibly this passage in my narrative brings to my mind a picture which used to be, some years ago, at a broker's—that charnel-house of the comforts and graces of life. It had been taken out of its frame, and leant in a dark and dusty corner against a perpendicular armchair, whose rigid uprightness seemed suited only to the parlour of a dentist, repose being the last idea it suggested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "810cd3c4-50a0-4706-a1c4-b5a01901811c",
                                                "sense_id": "38b0d4a9-bb43-3338-bfe1-b73ff65cbdb4",
                                                "text": "Thus Django becomes the carrier of the “public use of one's reason”—the Kantian road to enlightenment given to him by the German “Forty-Eighter” dentist–turned-bounty hunter Dr. “King” Schultz, and represents the fictive, allohistorical beginning of the battle against slavery and racism in the United States."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96427021-b589-33a7-9cf5-eccaacaee8d5",
                                        "entry_id": "090c221b-5989-3bd4-9b7d-740c71de482c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deliberate misspelling of Dengist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "deliberate",
                                            "misspelling"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba4dd47b-701e-45c7-8de1-c88b811527c0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2813465-44b9-386d-b9a9-993ce951e72b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ca462148-3f5b-3a26-b0f0-f92a69000d46",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizinerin, die sich mit der Zahnheilkunde beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "dentiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dentiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d28998f3-0194-36cc-bfd5-e2dbd33fa54e",
                                        "entry_id": "730b2b99-6a98-3395-85f1-6c7b6df497c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Spécialiste du soin des dents."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47a310e3-a096-4457-87f2-70be644e98d0",
                                                "sense_id": "d28998f3-0194-36cc-bfd5-e2dbd33fa54e",
                                                "text": "D’un air héroïque, presque farouche, comme s’il se trouvait devant un dentiste, qui propose de lui arracher une molaire, M. Hyacinthe s’écrie :\n— Finissons-en tout de suite…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eba5786-c2c2-41bc-be0f-685db25b542c",
                                                "sense_id": "d28998f3-0194-36cc-bfd5-e2dbd33fa54e",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu’il passe devant le bâtiment quelques minutes plus tard, il lit les plaques qui encadrent la porte vitrée. Il y en a cinq : deux dentistes, un kiné, un médecin, un orthophoniste — il n’a jamais entendu parler de ce métier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d01bc05d-409d-457c-8df2-bc01e725b0f1",
                                                "sense_id": "d28998f3-0194-36cc-bfd5-e2dbd33fa54e",
                                                "text": "Le dentiste peut profiter du temps de l’examen et du diagnostic pour renseigner son patient et s’entretenir avec lui."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
